# Checks run by .githooks/pre-push. One rule per line:
#   <git pathspecs> | <shell command>
# A rule runs when the pushed commits change a path matching its pathspecs.
# $VERIFY_CHANGED names a file listing the changed paths that still exist.
. :!*.md | python3 scripts/check-pages.py && python3 scripts/check-design-lock.py
